# Quality / Security

Severity:
- S0 Blocker
- S1 Critical
- S2 Major
- S3 Minor
- S4 Trivial

Release blocked by:
- any S0;
- unresolved core-path S1.

Critical templates/configs require 10,000+ generated-board simulation before release.

Required automated coverage:
- critical Game Engine rule paths;
- Solver parity/replay;
- Generator acceptance;
- Economy idempotency;
- Purchase validation/restore.

Security:
- never trust client Wallet balance;
- never trust client purchase status;
- no wildcard production Firestore rules;
- no secrets in client;
- privileged Admin writes through trusted backend boundary.

Before launch:
- automated security checks;
- focused manual/external penetration test.
